<#
.SYNOPSIS
  Adds the "New chat" picker (followed businesses) and fixes chat names showing
  e-mail addresses, in cavallo-app (backend) and cavallo-mobile (Flutter).

.DESCRIPTION
  Backend (cavallo-app):
    - chat/serializers.py : display name = business name -> customer name ->
                            full name -> e-mail prefix (never the raw e-mail);
                            new FollowedBusinessSerializer
    - chat/views.py       : new FollowedBusinessListView
    - chat/urls.py        : GET /api/v1/conversations/following/
    - chat/test_followed_businesses.py (new tests)
  Mobile (cavallo-mobile, written against branch part-111 / P-115 restyle):
    - "New chat (test)" button -> "New chat"; it opens a bottom sheet listing the
      businesses you follow; picking one starts/resumes the conversation.
    - chat_list_screen.dart, conversation_repository.dart (edited)
    - ARB strings (en + ar) + the committed generated l10n files (edited)
    - followed_business.dart, new_chat_sheet.dart, new_chat_sheet_test.dart (new)

  Safe to run twice (already-applied edits are skipped). Every changed file is
  backed up next to itself as <name>.bak_newchat before it is modified. Nothing
  is written unless ALL edits can be applied cleanly.

.EXAMPLE
  .\apply-newchat-fixes.ps1
  .\apply-newchat-fixes.ps1 -BackendPath D:\Cavallo\scd-backend -MobilePath D:\Cavallo\social_commerce_app -RunChecks
#>
